 <h2 style="color: #1a73e8; text-align: center;">Welcome to Insurances Ally – Take Your First 
Step Today</h2>
 <p>Hello <strong><%= name %></strong>,</p>
 <p>Welcome to <strong>Insurance Ally!</strong> You’ve just taken a big step to protect 
yourself <em>before</em> a claim ever happens—and you’ve joined a growing group of 
advocates who are changing the insurance industry.</p>
 <h3 style="color: #1a73e8;">What This Means for You</h3>
 <p>✅ <strong>You’re protected.</strong> When a claim happens, you already have 
professionals ready to fight for you.</p>
 <p>✅ <strong>You’re not alone.</strong> You’re part of a community standing up for fair 
treatment.</p>
 <p>✅ <strong>We’ll keep you informed.</strong> Expect updates, tips, and real success 
stories from members just like you.</p>
 <h3 style="color: #1a73e8;">What to Do Next – Act Now</h3>
 <p>✅ <strong>Log into your account:</strong></p>
 <p style="text-align: center;">
 <a href="<%= verificationLink %>" style="display: inline-block; background-color: #1a73e8; color: #ffffff; 
text-decoration: none; padding: 12px 20px; border-radius: 5px; font-weight: bold;">
 VERIFY YOUR ACCOUNT NOW
 </a>
 </p>
 <p>✅ <strong>Save this email</strong> so you can reach us fast if you ever need help.</p>
 <p>✅ <strong>Tell a friend or neighbor</strong>—every new member makes our collective 
voice stronger against unfair insurance practices.</p>
 <p>✅ <strong>Once you’re logged in, send us a copy of your policy.</strong> This is the 
first step to protecting yourself. We’ll review it to make sure you have the proper coverage so 
when a claim happens, there are no surprises.</p>
 <p style="margin-top: 20px;"><strong>Welcome aboard, [First Name]—you’re now part of 
the change.</strong></p>
 <p style="font-weight: bold;">– The Insurances Ally Team</p>
 </div>
